id: pm-starter-sdk-harness-1106
title: Adopt SDK harness for starter smoke registration and invocation
description: Replace residual handwritten positive extension hosts in smoke tests with the public SDK testing harness and teach the recommended real-tracker pattern in README.
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: sdk-adoption,testing
