close_reason: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/pull/195 merged 2026-11-06T20:18:49Z; merge SHA 7ddfc1460e748dafcbb782b75824c1ac336b5412; PR head 7d672a62203bee028149e094b695df871472d4da. Delivered: SDK extension harness owns positive smoke registration/invocation in real no-git trackers; README pattern and schema, flag, output, mutation and complete-read regressions have twelve isolated behavioral reverts. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Hound. Other check outcomes: enable-auto-merge: SKIPPED; cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green)."
